# Texas Multiple Award Schedule (TXMAS) Program

### The TXMAS Program adapts existing competitively awarded federal government or any other governmental entity contracts to service the procurement needs of state agencies and Texas SmartBuy members.

The Schedule Contract experts at DKA can assist with obtaining and maintaining your TXMAS Schedule contract.

### Over 400 Schedule Contracts Awarded.

We’ve assisted more than 400 companies list and maintain their products and services on Schedule contracts.

### DKA adds substantial value to its Schedule clients.

Once your company is on a Schedule Contract, DKA can help you find contracts to pursue and help you successfully prepare and submit your proposals. Our Schedule services include contract and proposal assistance, maintenance and more.

[Get Started Today](#contact)

